dialect protocol
protocol playbook.spr
version 1
schema playbook.program.operation
start record
framing record
record playbook.playbook-add-layer tag 1
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record playbook.playbook-set-stroke tag 2
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record playbook.playbook-move-layer tag 3
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
chain hash u64
